    "show_share": true,
    "description": "CIME Nairobi hosted the first Basic Life Support (BLS) training in the new centre on June 17th 2021, within a week of our official opening. 12 participants attended this training from the phlebotomy department, surgical department as well as the children's ward of the Aga Khan University Hospital, Nairobi.",
